Richard,

Miguel and I went back through the price extract this afternoon. The original=
 total stays at $500,000. On p. 4, the $28,000 outlet-protection detail is al=
ready inside the $148,000 revised line; I had added it a second time. Removin=
g that duplicate brings the revised total to $582,000, a difference of $82,00=
0, or 16.4%, rather than 22%.

Please replace the paragraph in the desk copy and the explanatory chart toget=
her with the attached versions. Both use the same five comparable, tax-exclus=
ive items across the three FY23 sections. These are price estimates, not fina=
l spending or completed work, and they do not describe all 18 contracts. Migu=
el's workbook traces the lines back to the extract and also shows how the ear=
lier figure arose.

Thanks,
Leslie

